{"task_span_id":"span_e22e4d","text":"调用多媒体转码引擎执行格式标准化处理，将源视频统一重编码为目标标准容器格式及兼容编解码器，输出符合跨平台播放规范的中间文件。"},{"task_span_id":"span_3feff6","text":"基于时序采样与视觉差异度分析算法对全片进行特征比对，筛选出画面突变点与核心信息节点作为关键帧，生成带时间戳标记的图像集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_3eed65","text":"依据精确到秒的时间轴定位指令，在已标准化文件中截取00:12至00:28的连续音视频流段，采用流拷贝或低损耗重编码策略生成独立切片文件。"},{"task_span_id":"span_139e67","text":"对转换后的统一格式视频、关键帧图像集及截取片段执行完整性校验与格式合规性检查，汇总处理日志与资源清单并完成最终交付归档。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_1cb6a8","scene":"program_snippet","scene_name":"程序片段","text":"我将把这段视频转换成统一格式，提取关键帧，并截取00:12到00:28的片段保存下来。","params":{"处理目标":"视频格式转换、关键帧提取、截取00:12到00:28片段保存"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_1cb6a8","scene":"program_snippet","scene_name":"程序片段","text":"我将把这段视频转换成统一格式，提取关键帧，并截取00:12到00:28的片段保存下来。","params":{"处理目标":"视频格式转换、关键帧提取、截取00:12到00:28片段保存"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：代码内容。用户提供的函数、类、脚本、源码文件或裸代码片段","提取可选参数：编程语言。代码片段所属语言，如 Python、Java、C++、JavaScript 等","提取可选参数：处理目标。用户希望执行的代码处理任务，如格式校验、AST 解析、标准化、语义意图识别、元数据标注、IO 提取、调用图、数据流、业务流程图、组件文档、示例生成或组件封装"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:53551489-96b0-42da-b52b-e458c6a0512c"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"请把这段视频转换成统一格式，提取关键帧，并截取 00:12 到 00:28 的片段保存下来。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"请把这段视频转换成统一格式，提取关键帧，并截取 00:12 到 00:28 的片段保存下来。","scene":"program_snippet","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"code-semantic-labeler","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"code-splitter-adapter","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"code-to-ast-new","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"dataflow-extractor","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"opengrep-compliance","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["code-semantic-labeler","code-splitter-adapter","code-to-ast-new","dataflow-extractor","opengrep-compliance"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["code-semantic-labeler","code-splitter-adapter","code-to-ast-new","dataflow-extractor","opengrep-compliance"],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:53551489-96b0-42da-b52b-e458c6a0512c"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":["code-semantic-labeler","code-splitter-adapter","code-to-ast-new","dataflow-extractor","opengrep-compliance"],"allowed_tool_names":[]}

